#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Disables the theme, plugin and core update checking, the related cronjobs "
"and notification system."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-osdwp-security-mode.php:224
msgid "Enable security updates only (block major updates)"
msgstr ""

#. URI of the plugin
msgid "https://wordpress.org/plugins/disable-wordpress-updates/"
msgstr ""

