msgstr ""

#: includes/class-osdwp-security-mode.php:199
msgid ""
"Implemented with WordPress filters only — no wp-config.php edits. Plugin and "
"theme auto-updates are not affected by this setting."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-osdwp-security-mode.php:302
msgid "minor / security only"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-osdwp-security-mode.php:299
msgid "no core updates"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-osdwp-security-mode.php:204
msgid ""
"Note: this setting controls which core releases are eligible for automatic "
"updates. If the automatic updater is disabled site-wide (for example via the "
"AUTOMATIC_UPDATER_DISABLED constant/filter, or by this plugin's own update-"
"blocking features), that takes precedence and no core update will be applied "
"automatically regardless of this toggle."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "Oliver Schlöbe"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-osdwp-security-mode.php:159
msgid "Security Mode"
msgstr ""

#: disable-updates.php:270
msgid "Security Mode enabled."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-osdwp-security-mode.php:328
msgid ""
"Security Mode is enabled: WordPress core automatic updates are restricted to "
"minor and security releases. Major version updates are intentionally blocked."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-osdwp-security-mode.php:194
msgid ""
"Security Mode restricts WordPress core automatic updates to minor and "
"security releases. Major version and development (nightly) core updates are "
"blocked from being applied automatically."
msgstr ""

